% The dimensions of Target_right are set to the VEHICLE-Preset: [Width: 1.83 m, Length: 4.65 m, PivotPoint: -3.5 m].
% The dimensions of Target_left are set to the VEHICLE-Preset: [Width: 1.83 m, Length: 4.65 m, PivotPoint: -3.5 m].
% The initial conditions of Ego are set to: [Start-Speed: 0 kph, Start-Heading: 0 deg].
% The initial conditions of Target_right are set to: [Start-Speed: 36 kph, Start-Heading: 0 deg].
% The initial conditions of Target_left are set to: [Start-Speed: 36 kph, Start-Heading: 0 deg].
% The initial conditions of Target_right are set to: [Start-Speed: 36 kph, Start-Heading: 0 deg].
% The initial conditions of Target_left are set to: [Start-Speed: 36 kph, Start-Heading: 0 deg].
% The initial conditions of Target_right are set to: [Start-Speed: 36 kph, Start-Heading: 0 deg].
% The initial conditions of Target_left are set to: [Start-Speed: 36 kph, Start-Heading: 0 deg].
% The end position of Target_right is shifted by Lateral-Offset: 3.5 m, Longitudinal-Offset: -50 mHeading: 0°.
% The end position of Target_left is shifted by Lateral-Offset: -4 m, Longitudinal-Offset: -50 mHeading: 0°.
% The end position of Target_right is shifted by Lateral-Offset: 3 m, Longitudinal-Offset: -50 mHeading: 0°.
% The end position of Target_left is shifted by Lateral-Offset: -3.8 m, Longitudinal-Offset: -50 mHeading: 0°.
